# fixedbugs, defect 143, panel 185 R1, lane ffi-macro, 2026-10-02.
#
# The width panel 185 measured reading out of bounds through the macro,
# `status: u8` where `WEXITSTATUS` takes the address of an `int`: the
# function the note drafts must not carry it, or the author's own header
# holds the hole. Every C type in the draft is a placeholder; the
# parameter's NAME is the declaration's, since a name corrupts nothing.

extern "sys/wait.h"
    function WEXITSTATUS(status: u8) -> i64  #~ ffi_macro_name

function main()
    print(WEXITSTATUS(status: 1))
